Ezrik Oreskalka is the head of the [[Org/Althane/Oreskalka Cabal|Oreskalka Cabal]], the vampire family of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. He is the one member of the family strong enough to bring a person back from death, and the rest of the family would not move to raise another without him.

[[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] left the family with his sire and does not go near the hold, since the cabal has a contract out on him.
